OL,3,GNEWSACockerel dumping rise despite     
OL,4,Aallotment ban U-turn                   
OL,6,FCockerel dumping has increased despite 
OL,7,Fa council overturning its decision to  
OL,8,Fban the birds from allotments, a       
OL,9,Frescuer said.                          
OL,11,FFounder of Darlington Bird Rescue Laura
OL,12,FHewitt said the number of abandoned    
OL,13,Fcockerels had increased "exponentially"
OL,14,Fsince Durham County Council banned the 
OL,15,Fbirds on its allotments in March and   
OL,16,Fgave owners 12 months to adhere to the 
OL,17,Frule.                                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
