OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACockerel dumping rise despite     
OL,4,Aallotment ban U-turn                   
OL,6,FDespite the ban U-turn, the birds      
OL,7,Fcontinue to be dumped and Hewitt       
OL,8,Festimated she had been called out to   
OL,9,Frescue more than 50 birds this year    
OL,10,Fincluding 22 abandoned on one occasion.
OL,12,FThe council's neighbourhood protection 
OL,13,Fmanager Ian Hoult said it reversed the 
OL,14,Fban "following consultation with the   
OL,15,Fpublic".                               
